  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span data-preserver-spaces="true">In the end, all the sacrifice addresses are taken with point totals plus the bonus added from largest to smallest in order—the first address at 3x bonus to the last slightly above 1x. Now everyone has received their well-deserved compensation for speaking out on eco-friendly electricity usage. This now can be seen on a linear bonding curve from 1x+ to 3x.</span>
